  "description": "Command center for the mjolnir LLM inference fleet: aggregate usage + cost, workload distribution by app/model, and live inference load. Data: Prometheus (litellm gateway, llamacpp pods, DCGM). Cost figures are estimates driven by the Cloud rate profile dropdown (per-token-type cloud_model_rates) and Electricity $/kWh.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
